  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 (RNA encoder) outperforms pca_n2000 in RNA-only multiprofile setups (0.6501 vs 0.5907). This experiment tests combining scvi_n200 with multimodal data (ResNet50 images) using avgpool aggregation and concat fusion, isolating the impact of the superior RNA encoder in a multimodal context. It directly addresses whether multimodal integration can leverage the RNA encoder's strength, balancing exploitation of proven components with exploration of multimodal benefits."
}

